        "description": "EGDI (0–1) with its Online Service, Telecommunication Infrastructure and Human Capital components for all 41, from the biennial UN survey; the caveat names the year. `country`, `countries`, or a ranking by `index`. For information only; every response says so first.",
        "parameters": [
          {
